    "body": "Canonical Issue reads must stop depending on unauthenticated public API quota. Session supplies intent; the existing supervisor supplies one repository-scoped GitHub App installation token. The reader only consumes it.\n\nN: this specification and metrics. P: shortest Session route and missing-input owner. L: authenticated read/conditional-cache/quota gates consumed by real admission before effects. R: exact GitHub response and provider-enforced token scope; neither local GREEN nor capability success closes the Issue.\n\nThe installation was read back as App 4753873, installation 157336758, with access to ed3c/soodles. Live proof must request only repositories=[soodles], permissions={issues:read}, plus implicit metadata. Credentials and private keys never enter evidence.\n\n<!-- soodles:execution-v1 -->\n```json\n{\n  \"schema\": 1,\n  \"trigger\": \"Canonical Issue reads currently use unauthenticated GitHub REST and exhaust the shared IP quota; a real #39 treatment was interrupted.\",\n  \"source\": \"Session request: one physically evidenced GitHub App minimum-use atom, referencing noodles github ceremony at d4fa0da322cbb7a581328398906a4f04deaf0a69.\",\n  \"owner\": \"Soodles Issue provider reader; supervisor owns credential supply; existing Noodle and landing owners retain lifecycle/delivery.\",\n  \"changes\": [\n    \"Add one authenticated Issue-read entry shared by Session CLI and automatic/supervised/worker consumers.\",\n    \"Consume an externally supplied installation token; never mint, rotate, discover another identity, or fall back to anonymous requests in the reader.\",\n    \"Reuse identity/URL-bound ETag bytes only after authenticated provider 304; retain quota headers and return bounded wait without retry.\",\n    \"Document the P-class shortest route and preserve scoped live App evidence.\"\n  ],\n  \"write_paths\": [\n    \".agents/skills/verify-soodles/SKILL.md\",\n    \".agents/skills/verify-soodles/features/README.md\",\n    \".agents/skills/verify-soodles/features/github-read.md\",\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/app-scope-readback.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/consumer-tests-final.txt\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/control-correction.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/first-live-refusal/diagnosis.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/first-live-refusal/live-cli-1.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/first-live-refusal/live-receipt.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/first-live-refusal/opaque-control-green.txt\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/first-live-refusal/opaque-control-red.txt\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/fixed-oracle/test_github_reader.py\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/gate-receipt.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/live-cli-1.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/live-cli-2.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/live-read.py\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/live-receipt.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/oracle-selection.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/production-owner-readback.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/reader-tests-final.txt\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/receipt.json\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/run-controls.py\",\n    \"docs/evidence/github-read/unit-tests.txt\",\n    \"github_reader.py\",\n    \"issue_execution.py\",\n    \"soodles.py\",\n    \"tests/test_github_reader.py\",\n    \"tests/test_issue_execution.py\"\n  ],\n  \"behavior\": [\n    \"Missing/invalid credentials fail before any unauthenticated request or admission effect; redirect refuses before token forwarding.\",\n    \"Fresh authenticated 200 or 304 supplies exact Issue JSON to the existing admission validator; reads do not authorize delivery.\",\n    \"Quota/reset state returns structured owner/required/next with exit 75; no stale-success result, alternate identity or retry loop.\"\n  ],\n  \"defect_controls\": [\n    \"Prove old anonymous-reader defect RED using the same no-anonymous control that passes GREEN after correction; legal authenticated read GREEN.\",\n    \"For cache identity/304, redirect, quota/no-retry gates retain planted-defect RED, corrected same control GREEN, and legitimate non-case GREEN.\",\n    \"Exercise real shared admission consumer with a restricted App token and capture HTTP status/rate headers/actual exit codes without secrets.\"\n  ],\n  \"non_cases\": [\n    \"Authenticated unchanged Issue returns server 304 and exact saved bytes; correct rejection is GREEN.\",\n    \"Provider failure/missing credential/quota wait preserves mailbox and does not spawn worker.\",\n    \"This atom does not recover the paused #39 stale Noodle proposal or rerun its comparison, does not guarantee global network blocking, and does not claim reduced Agent decision cost.\"\n  ],\n  \"dependencies\": [\n    {\n      \"repository\": \"ed3c/noodle\",\n      \"issue\": 84,\n      \"owner\": \"Noodle initial admission\",\n      \"evidence\": \"https://github.com/ed3c/noodle/blob/64f70ad1d33994446599c0aca11e01fdb10e9aa3/docs/evidence/initial-admission-recovery/final-delivery/receipt.json\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"acceptance\": \"Focused discriminating controls plus supervisor-selected immutable external controls; canonical acceptance once for final clean candidate on lock-matching Linux carrier. Live macOS App evidence remains scoped separately.\",\n  \"delivery\": \"Existing externally selected landing owner only, exact-head successful provider CI and fresh supervisor admission before prepare/dispatch; transport exact emitted connector request, read back merge and Issue closure.\",\n  \"reconciliation\": \"Existing Noodle owner reconciles this atom worktree and local main before RESOLVED. Preserve #39 pending mailbox/worktree and any unknown writes.\",\n  \"feature_scope\": \"Authenticated Soodles Issue reader and P-class shortest entry; no new scheduler, retry engine, credential broker or provider policy flag.\"\n}\n```\n<!-- /soodles:execution-v1 -->\n\n## Implementation and scoped readback \u2014 2026-09-17\n\nImplemented in draft [PR #45](https://github.com/ed3c/soodles/pull/45), candidate `0cda9c2ee57ed598257048f50829fb36893d3b80`.\n\n- N: [immutable receipt and referenced raw evidence](https://github.com/ed3c/soodles/blob/0cda9c2ee57ed598257048f50829fb36893d3b80/docs/evidence/github-read/receipt.json) records scope and measurements; no absolute minimum-cost or Agent decision-cost claim.\n- P: `./soodles github issue NUMBER` is the Session entry. The existing supervisor supplies a repository-scoped installation token in the actual child's `GH_TOKEN`; the recipe names the existing supplier and exact repository/permission restrictions. Missing input and quota wait identify their owner and existing continuation.\n- L: automatic/supervised/worker share the authenticated reader. Eleven frozen external defect RED \u2192 corrected same control GREEN \u2192 legal non-case GREEN triplets pass, as do 16 reader and 16 consumer tests. No credential means no request; no anonymous fallback, redirect forwarding, stale success or automatic retry. Quota wait returns 75 and preserves the existing mailbox/worker boundary.\n- R: App 4753873 / installation 157336758 minted only `ed3c/soodles`, `issues:read` and implicit `metadata:read`. Final source CLI observations are HTTP 200 \u2192 304 with remaining 6198 \u2192 6198. Token revocation returned 204. [Exact-head Linux canonical acceptance](https://github.com/ed3c/soodles/actions/runs/35189253585), attempt 1, job 105097957080, passed; quality-report also passed.\n\nThe real automatic consumer read live #44 through the default authenticated reader, but its Noodle state was explicitly a local owner fixture. This is not a live Noodle worker/typed-outcome or full delivery claim. The earlier token-alphabet defect and macOS/Linux-test mismatch remain preserved rather than relabeled as successes.\n\n**Still OPEN / delivery pending:** the production Noodle root contains no original `soodles-44` order and retains the paused pending proposal at revision `dfb96fcf7d8d776ea177173c4c0c717d`. The existing landing owner requires the completed original order and quiescent sessions before terminal reconciliation. No merge/closure was offered; no production state reset, replacement scheduler or #39 retry occurred. The code and physical reader proof do not remove that distinct lifecycle requirement. This body update also requires a fresh supervisor envelope before future admission; prior live receipts retain their original body identity.\n\n\n## Fresh supervised continuation \u2014 2026-09-17\nNoodle #84 is provider-delivered and its original order reconciled. Its explicitly selected native binary safely retired the rejected #39 proposal through exact owner next; canonical checkpoint and orders projection bytes were unchanged, no #39 comparison restarted. The old delivery-pending paragraph is historical evidence, not the current proposal state.\n\nBefore further delivery, establish the genuine `soodles-44` order to perform fresh authenticated CLI 200/304 and refusal drives, exact candidate review and Agent-produced typed outcome. This is substantive verification/delivery continuation of the already disclosed implementation, not a claim that an order predated earlier code. Do not create an empty completed order. The fixed external controls remain selected outside this candidate; the supervisor pins the already tested reader for this bootstrap and provides only the scoped read token. Exact file paths above replace ambiguous directory labels without expanding the correction.\n",
